        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "If this is an edge case, it is not bound to 1st-ly added Friend without request.\n\nI have tried to add yet another Friend in the same way (without request) and same as before the friendship was not established. (no need to mention that Friend I was adding had only added me without request AND without other friends in the friend-list as well)\n\nBut immediately I have add other Friend (now) with request, and other side accepted the request, both previously waiting friendships (now 2 of them) were established right away.\n\nIt looks to me like for establishing friendship without request, some other party (friend in the friend-list) has to be there at least on 1 end in order it to work.",
