            "body": "@Green-Sky I appreciate that you look inside the code for this, however I think you are looking at the wrong place. as issue is that friendship is not being established and not that added friends with norequest are loaded. they are loaded alright, the friendship is not being established (in situation described earlier), that is what is not alright.\n\nso the issue may be somewhere in the network part of exchanging data in regard of establishing friendship with friends added without request and not in place where they are loaded.",
